            "paragraph": "To understand the climate effects of sulphate and BC aerosols due to the total response to rapid adjustment, both the simulations with prescribed sea surface temperatures (SSTs) and sea ice\u00b9\u2079 and with an ocean general circulation model (OGCM)\u00b9\u00b9, were executed for each of the perturbed emissions.",
