            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "The climate sensitivity parameter (i.e. the gradient of plots shown in Fig. 2a) estimated by MIROC-SPRINTARS for sulphate aerosols (1.3\u00b0C W\u00af\u00b9 m\u00b2) is eight times larger than that for BC (0.16\u00b0C W\u00af\u00b9 m\u00b2).",
